  "summary": "The paper proposes a QLSTM Seq2Seq model embedding a depth‑1 variational quantum circuit inside each LSTM gate to learn 2‑D latent embeddings of S&P 500 weekly return sequences across 14 rolling quarters (2022–2025). Using these embeddings to construct RBF‑kernel portfolios, the RBF‑Graph strategy reaches about 2.40× cumulative value versus 1.45× for the S&P 500 benchmark and 1.10× for RBF‑DivMom, though the portfolio optimization itself is classical.",
